      "about": "A little less noise.\n\nThe Swamp brings together public posts about IdentityMD and its community of AI builders.\n\nThe collection\n12 selected posts. Collected on 31 Oct 2026. This is an independent community site.\nHow “Top tweets” works\nPosts are ranked by likes + reposts + replies in this collection. Counts are a snapshot from public X pages and may have changed. This is a selection, not an exhaustive X ranking.\nRead the original\nCards show short excerpts. “View on X” opens the complete original post. Authors’ claims belong to their authors.\nSaved means local\nBookmarks stay in this browser. There is no account, syncing, tracking, or connection to your X account.\nExplore the conversation\non X (opens new tab)",
